WEBVTT

00:03:59.568 --> 00:04:00.569
you were safe.

00:04:00.903 --> 00:04:02.488
And I’m talking about those of us

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:06.075
who are lucky enough not to live
locked with an abuser,

00:04:06.075 --> 00:04:07.743
victims of domestic abuse.

00:04:08.286 --> 00:04:09.620
So for those of us,

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.247
the safe bubble was inside.

00:04:11.872 --> 00:04:13.040
Or so we thought.

00:04:14.166 --> 00:04:17.837
On August 4, 2020 in Lebanon,

00:04:17.837 --> 00:04:19.005
our lives changed.

00:04:19.672 --> 00:04:21.007
In a split of a second,

00:04:21.007 --> 00:04:24.885
one of the largest non-nuclear
explosions pulverized our port

00:04:24.885 --> 00:04:27.096
and destroyed half our city,

00:04:27.096 --> 00:04:28.097
killing many people

00:04:28.097 --> 00:04:29.265
and destroying homes

00:04:29.265 --> 00:04:32.393
and creating losses
that we can’t even count until today.